## 1. Applicable to a dependent family member of.-  
- (a) a Government servant who dies in service (including death by suicide);
- (b) is retired on medical grounds before attaining the age of 55 years (57 years in the case of Group 'D' (MTS) officials);
- (i) dies in service; or (ii) killed in action; or (iii) is medically boarded
- (c) a member of the Armed Forces whoout and unfit for civil employment.
